PROPS SET for POSER-DAZ Standard Characters. CHARACTERS NOT INCLUDED. [DAZ is a free Software].
____________________________________________
The Ancient Rome A, as depicted on Piazza Armerina Mosaics. 4 HD 3D models for POSER SydneyG2-JessiG2 & DAZ Victoria4-LanaGenesis. 23 textures. Accurate Reconstruction. C4D, 3DS, OBJ, POSER, DAZ, VUE6 to 11.
____________________________________________
Ancient Rome A, as seen on the most famous Piazza Armerina Roman Mosaics [Villa Romana del Casale].
From Poser 7 to Poser Pro 2012. From DAZ 3 to DAZ 4.5.
For Poser-Daz Standard Characters. Characters Not Included.  
SmartCgArt is member of the Archaeological Institute of America [AIA] and of the American Philological Association [APA].  
Real World Scale Model [SmartCgArt Real World System]. Quads [C4D; OBJ; POSER/DAZ] & Tris [VUE;3DS].  
Collection of 4 3D Models with 23 Photoreal and Alternate textures.
3 complete Props Sets ready to be used with POSER [Sydney G2 and Jessi G2] and DAZ [Victoria 4 character, Genesis Lana][DAZ is a free Software].  
When in , women used to perform sports, as weight-lifting, discus throwing, running and ball-games.  
Faithful and accurate Reconstruction of a Ancient Rome A, ing to the Scientific Data and the Archaeological Evidence. As seen on the most famous Piazza Armerina Roman Mosaics [Villa Romana del Casale].  
In the package you will find these props:
1- typical Roman A Upper and Lower Parts for Woman [Sculpted HD];
2- 1 Roman Leather Ball with real Roman Colours;
3- 2 Weights;
4- 1 Discus;
5- Complete SET ready for POSER 7 and Up SYDNEY G2 and JESSI G2 characters;
6- Complete SET ready for DAZ VICTORIA 4 character;
7- Complete SET ready for DAZ GENESIS LANA character;
8- 23 Hi-Quality Hi-Def PhotoReal Textures [2048x1024; 1000x1000; 756x512; 512x512; etc.];
9- Alternate Textures and UVMaps to create different types of elements;
10- .txt TUTORIAL guides to the correct rendering;
11- Real World Scale SmartCgArt Man Reference System with models [C4D, VUE, 3DS, OBJ, DXF].  
All the Models are prepared Hi-DEF and Photoreal, perfect for any type of Rendering!  
POLYGONS/VERTICES COUNT [complete all models Package]
C4D-OBJ-POSER/DAZ: only/mostly quads [9460; 9465]
VUE-3DS: triangulated [18376; 9465]  
Enjoy THE ARCHAEO.SYS 3D SERIES.  
These models are useful for many types of sceneries, ancient sceneries but also modern ones, as for Roman re-enactment.  
The Archaeo.Sys 3D series is developing high-fidelity 3D reconstruction of Objects, Architecture and Scenes from Classical Greek and Roman Antiquity.

Classical Greek Corinthian Helmet Model A, the most famous helmet used by the Greek armoured infantry men, the 'hoplites', especially during the 6th, 5th and 4th century BC.Real World Scale Model [Real World System]. Quads [C4D; OBJ] & Tris [VUE;3DS].And PBR VUE 2023 model and Greek Bronze Textures.
Greek Helmet Corinthian A1 - 6th-5th BC.In use mainly ca. 6th and 5th century BC and sometimes also later.The Crest Holder System and the Crest Hair are removable.In fact, this Helmet (poly.43974) could be used with or without the Crest Holder and Crest Hair (poly.113464) but with the peg System or totally smooth without any kind of Crest.
After an original Greek Helmet model Denda type.
Real World Scale Model [Real World System]. Quads [C4D; OBJ] & Tris [VUE;3DS].And PBR VUE 2023 model and Greek Bronze Textures.
SmartCgArt is member of the Archaeological Institute of America-AIA.
Faithful and accurate Reconstruction of a Greek Helmet Corinthian A1 - 6th-5th BC.The Crest Holder System and the Crest Hair are removable.In fact, this Helmet could be used with or without the Crest Holder but with the peg System or totally 'smooth' without any kind of Crest.
In the package you will find:

  - Greek Helmet Corinthian A (ca. 6th-5th BC);

  - original Greek Crest Holder System (removable);

  - Greek Crest Hair with 3D Hair (removable);

  - 10 Hi-Quality PhotoReal Textures [756x512];

  - Alternate Textures to create different types of elements;

  - 9 PBR Greek Bronze Textures;

  - VUE 2023 PBR Model;

  - Tutorials for Poser/Daz Obj Import;

  - Real World Scale SmartCgArt Man Reference System with models [C4D, VUE, 3DS, OBJ, DXF].

All the Models are prepared Hi-DEF and Photoreal, perfect for any type of Rendering!
